# Staging and recovery timing per configuration: `BOWSHOCK_EXAMPLE=two_stage cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/timing.drive out/timing`
# The separation inspector (Separates on / Ignites on with each trigger kind, the sequence and the long-coast chip), the
# configuration menu with ballast, and a parachute's per-configuration deployment.
viewport 1280x800
move (640, 400)
click "2D"
# Select the separation: the default timing (burnout, then ignition on separation).
click (690, 300)
screenshot timing-1-default.png
# Open the "Ignites on" select: Separation, burnout, time from launch, altitude.
click (1175, 447)
screenshot timing-2-ignites-menu.png
click "Time from launch"
screenshot timing-3-ignition-time.png
# Time from launch: the delay is the time from launch. Make it 6 s: a long coast after the 1.8 s separation.
click (1175, 481)
type "6"
type enter
screenshot timing-4-long-coast.png
# "Separates on": burnout, time from launch, altitude.
click (1175, 315)
screenshot timing-5-separates-menu.png
click "Altitude"
screenshot timing-6-separation-altitude.png
# Light the sustainer on an altitude too (the sequence then comes from a flight).
click (1175, 482)
click (1143, 456)
screenshot timing-7-both-altitude.png
# The configuration menu: ballast of the current configuration.
click (122, 781)
screenshot timing-8-config-menu.png
# Ballast: 40 g in the current configuration (it goes in the nose until moved), then a duplicate that carries it.
click (163, 721)
type "40"
type enter
screenshot timing-9-ballast.png
click "Duplicate current"
click (122, 781)
screenshot timing-10-two-configs.png
# A parachute's deployment is stored with the configuration (PER CONFIG badge).
click (700, 560)
click (502, 702)
screenshot timing-11-parachute.png
# Deploy on "Time from launch" in this configuration; the first configuration still deploys on the ejection charge.
click (1180, 393)
click "Time from launch"
screenshot timing-12-parachute-launch.png
click (122, 781)
click (100, 556)
screenshot timing-13-parachute-other-config.png
